{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/460989-demon-rules-summary-one-sheet","id":460989,"title":"Demon Rules Summary One-Sheet","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-29T06:16:06-07:00","id":460989,"title":"Demon Rules Summary One-Sheet","content":"Hi all. Well, tonight my group has our Session Zero (character creation and Prelude discussion) for our Gilded Age: Demon game and all four of my players (and me as a Storyteller) are new to Demon: the Descent. Does anyone know of a good one-page rules summary with a quick description of each of the major systems specific to Demon? It doesn't have to be detailed, it just needs to run down what Demons can do and a very quick summary of how all the systems work.<br /> <br /> Anyone interested in my general Gilded Age Chronicle prospectus, by the way, can check these two tumblr posts:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://michaelgrasso.tumblr.com/post/88848100569/demon-the-descent-campaign-prospectus-non\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/0fec7d01c15146e5d2195f05d558beda/tumblr_inline_pk2jm1Po9G1qhjeaf_500.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://michaelgrasso.tumblr.com/post/88848100569/demon-the-descent-campaign-prospectus-non\" target=\"_blank\"> [Demon: The Descent] Campaign Prospectus: Non Serviam </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://michaelgrasso.tumblr.com/post/88848100569/demon-the-descent-campaign-prospectus-non\" target=\"_blank\"> http://michaelgrasso.tumblr.com/post/88848100569/demon-the-descent-campaign-prospectus-non </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Real wealth consists in things of utility and beauty, in things that help to create strong, beautiful bodies and surroundings inspiring to live in. But if man is doomed to wind cotton around a spool,... </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://michaelgrasso.tumblr.com/post/88850816924/directors-commentary-campaign-prospectus-non\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/498f1f34455a93e74f017401926c50c2/5a11085358833c62-2e/s16x16u_c1/a6812b63b0a1c137d8ddfce169f8b8d125dc15e0.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://michaelgrasso.tumblr.com/post/88850816924/directors-commentary-campaign-prospectus-non\" target=\"_blank\"> Director's Commentary: Campaign Prospectus: Non Serviam </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://michaelgrasso.tumblr.com/post/88850816924/directors-commentary-campaign-prospectus-non\" target=\"_blank\"> http://michaelgrasso.tumblr.com/post/88850816924/directors-commentary-campaign-prospectus-non </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> 1. There is no lack of character concepts for this game, or perhaps I should more accurately say \"Cover concepts.\" Anyone who had a reason or opportunity to line up against the Bosses is right on. As... </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Thanks,<br /> <br /> Mike","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5109-mgrasso","name":"mgrasso","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T12:08:30-07:00","id":461321,"title":"","content":"I think it's a bit more than a page, but you could buy the <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/124274/Demon-the-Descent-Storytellers-Screen\" target=\"_blank\">storyteller screen</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T18:39:01-07:00","id":461726,"title":"","content":"Thanks! I will check that out, and I also found this post from back when the Quickstart was first released: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/27377-demon-cheat-sheets\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...n-cheat-sheets</a>. I need to check to see if all the rules were the same in the final version of the Demon: the Descent corebook, but it's just the kind of thing I was looking for.<br /> <br /> Thanks also to all of you who liked my tumblr prospectus. Our Session Zero went quite well, although we did not come close to finishing all the character options in the 3 hours we had! Wiki link will be up in the next couple of weeks. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5109-mgrasso","name":"mgrasso","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Fe